      explanation: "The logic followed here is :- First number × ((First number + 2) × 2) + 2 = Second number. By using BODMAS RULE : 14 : 450 = 14 × ((14 + 2) × 2) + 2 = 14 ×(16 × 2)+ 2 =14 × 32+ 2 = 448 + 2 = 450 Similarly, 18 : 722 = 18 × ((18 + 2)× 2) + 2 = 18 ×(20 × 2)+ 2 =18 × 40+ 2 = 720 + 2 = 722 Hence, the correct answer is \"18 : 722\".",
