      explanation: "Calculation: T he total sales of the first branch for both years = 80 + 105 = 185 thousand The total sales of the fourth branch for both years = 85 + 95 = 180 thousand Now, the ratio = 185 : 180 = 37 : 36 ∴ The ratio of the total sales of the first branch for both years to the total sales of the fourth branch for both years is 37 : 36.",
